      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "拥有『ON』与『OFF』，两种反差强烈的面貌……\n同时又拥有压倒性的高远眼界与实力，\n这就是西沙里奥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6deb45c278384e83f235719c2ff9b2b062176c707fa05994fbd71b89884fe69",
