    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:848c541f95176883ce45e2d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我深深点头。签约以前见过的，空中救世主与\n西沙里奥的模拟赛浮现在脑海。\n那份锐利，那份锋芒――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aed5e61a557e45464937c66e3b8c7c353a7742239da2c45e84d0c159f48403e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        57,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/57/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e44087336f9f674f1485743",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外，我们刚才也听勇敢之心和\n莱茵力量，谈到了今后的规划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2aa937383cd933d85bfe2918a89f2fdc678dc5d52443c61052cf2bd0e03116",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111303.json",
      "json_path": [
