      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "着眼于明年的三后冠……\n她们已经要向最高等级的比赛，发起挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cbe8be40d13c3c11f2f3a27f3fb4c48fb60daec28905f490f769f68e3a77eb9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
